2975:## D250 · 2026-10-31 · Four evidence boundaries and the counting unit settled; the ruler is fixed before any further measurement (standard version 5)
2979:  1. **An arrangement retold without a new step** (Nokia AI-RAN collaboration, a carmaker's model on the platform, labs using a system): the lean as put: "只描述一个现成安排、没有新动作的，算背景，不收". An arrangement the item only describes as already in place (a collaboration, a customer using a product, a deployment), with no new step, is background and not kept, even when the item gives no date; everything else under the retelling row (D243 item 6, "看不出是旧事的不算重提") is judged as before, and guidance and a forecast or plan still in force keep their weight when retold.
2984:- The ruler (Alex: "你要修正尺子"): the standard page goes to version 5 with these rules, then a read-only drift review; the gold's evidence part is re-derived for version 5 (version 4 changed no evidence entry, `gold-v4-evidence-check.md`) by two independent readers with every disagreement decided against the article, written as a new frozen file with every change listed (before, after, reason), the version-3 file untouched (D243 item 11); the opening part of the gold is not re-derived here and the scorer reports no question score until it is. The scorer refuses a gold whose evidence part was made for another version of the page: `final_scores.py` had bypassed `score_gold.py`'s version check and scored rounds since D248 on the version-3 gold, which is the false measurement Alex names.
